{"kind":"request","text":"Please review J4 later-phases Source V13 for adoption. V13 answers your report 5628bef9 under planner rulings dcf500c5 and 6fd8beef. Both files below are frozen. If either changes, the review no longer applies.\n\nEvidence body SHA-256: 4997254d95a969fc64becd11203ed7216b37c0d3c3fdedce4bdd3600a4730717\nOperator Source SHA-256: 91c7da1770d42e3df406353b72450482ef8f66178852bf55f40594c171459a13\n\nSource: /private/tmp/artroom-j4-later-phases-source-20261031-v13, source-index.json sha256 0a66a6c47215e13222e16ec2384afd954f42bb942ba96d5c08b2a09bb86284b7, PINS.json sha256 c8c91b08bf020090e50a18766a0bd61950c9ed9707dbe26b543972d74da7c62c. Start with the V13 section of PLAN.md and v12-to-v13.patch, sha256 ebcc40d8742faa16472ec8dfd07cfd5a154a07b542690e774ee49e67b624d309. The evidence body and execution core 10c1d65d are unchanged from V12. I checked all 46 index rows against the files, in bytes, digest and mode, with 0 mismatches.\n\nNames. The planner chose nine in dcf500c5. The builder set five: sourceQualificationRoot /private/tmp/artroom-j4-v16-source-qualification-checks-20261031-v1, sourceQualificationFixtureRoot /private/tmp/artroom-j4-v16-source-qualification-fixtures-20261031-v1, reviewedSourceRoot (this Source), request d288fb900e99da30606cbbfca2b876391017152b, and promise 2325d2bdec8bb369d6c3cd77d8163d178ccacc09. The qualifier ran over the filled names.\n\nQualification capture: /private/tmp/artroom-j4-v16-source-qualification-checks-20261031-v1, source-filesystem-1. Receipt sha256 85f9a9803f2d699c982cb9c0fbfe9da3e4e18df5c115d07076819050f0823ff3, stdout sha256 dbf3435babd679e906f8f0be639044c61b74c6c104d7a0060412410aadf5cfd1. Exit 0, 28 of 28 cases passed, 0 network attempts, 0 private path attempts, Source unchanged.\n\nRehearsal capture: /private/tmp/artroom-j4-v13-rehearsal-20261031-v1/rehearsal-receipt.json, sha256 b6bedaafda1c2e981577f90b8b5f7d685fd4d92ea57d58c3c22c32a949f3913a. It classified rehearsal-complete, and the process exit was 0